;;; Bytes per call for float, complex, ratio and bignum arithmetic and the
;;; quotient functions on non-integers.  The row and its floor come from
;;; investigation/float-ratio-complex-allocation.md; the measurement is
;;; compiled-only because the interpreter does not use these entries.
